Assets removed from this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Earlier revisions of this repository bundled a third 3D model. It has been
removed because its license does not permit the kind of redistribution a
public repository necessarily performs.

"S.W.A.T. Operator - Remastered" by Mateusz Woliński (https://sketchfab.com/jeandiz)
  From: https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/swat-operator-remastered-732d2eec5a0c456bafedd08af35134c3
  License: Sketchfab Standard License (https://sketchfab.com/licenses)
  Reason for removal: that license prohibits making the licensed material
  available to third parties as a stand-alone file, and a file committed to a
  public repository is downloadable as a stand-alone file by anyone. The
  attribution requirement alone does not satisfy the license.

  The file remains in this repository's git history under earlier revisions.

